+## Currency independence (confirmed, Sprint 31 Phase 14)
+
+Sprint 31's security audit specifically checked whether a user's
+`currency_code` preference could affect billing calculations. It
+can't, and not because of a runtime guard — grepping every file under
+`lib/billing/` and `app/api/billing/**` for the word "currency" (Phase
+14) returns **zero matches**. Premium pricing is Stripe-managed fixed
+Price IDs (`STRIPE_PRICE_ID_PREMIUM_MONTHLY` etc., set once in env),
+never computed from anything in `profiles`. This section exists so
+that fact is verified and written down, not just assumed to be true
+because it sounds like it should be.
+
